  "description": "Go package-qualified selectors such as pkg.Name now resolve to exported symbols, producing CALLS, CONSTRUCTS, and USES_TYPE edges through an optional qualified-reference fact. Python package entries publish statically provable re-export routes from __init__, including a static __all__ filter, so from package import Name reaches the declaring symbol. Persisted IDs and the other language adapters stay unchanged.",
